NAME
     ValidUpdater – Update the valid database for revocation.

DESCRIPTION
     ValidUpdater is a system daemon that updates revocation database for
     trustd

     ValidUpdater is not intended to be invoked directly, but launchd though
     launchd.

SEE ALSO
     launchd(8) trustd(8)

